# What may enter the image build. Everything is refused, then three things are let in.
# A new file (a .env, a key, a dataset, the .git history) stays out unless it is added here
# on purpose, so a secret cannot slip into the image by accident.
*

!requirements.lock
!models/
!src/

# Inside those folders, leftovers of running the code locally stay out too.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info
